+
+   Instability reported with egcs on a RedHat Linux 7.3.
+   Let's comment out:
+   #define FASTCALL __attribute__((stdcall, regparm(3)))
+   and let's try this:
+*/
+#  define FASTCALL __attribute__((regparm(3)))
+#  define PTRFASTCALL __attribute__((regparm(3)))
+#endif
